  \oint A(\vx) e^{-n\psi(\log(\vx))} d\vx,
\]
for an appropriately defined function \( A(\vx) \) and $\psi(\vt) = - \log(P(e^{\vt})) + \vbeta^T \vt$, where $\vt=\log(\vx)$.

