Lemmas~\ref{lem:basis=factors1}-\ref{lem:factors1} will prove the necessity of termination condition~2 in Algorithm~\ref{alg:bridge_length}.
Both conditions 1 and 2 will guarantee the connectedness of the lifted periodic graph $G$ due to Lemma~\ref{lem:sufficiency}.

