\subsection{Ablation Studies: Effect of Temperature and Clip Norm}
\label{sec:ablation-temp-clip-norm}

\method has the following key hyperparameters: the batch size $\bsz$ (which is determined by the compute budget), temperature $\tau$, clip norm $\clipnorm$, and top-$k$ parameter.
