\section{Conclusions}

\begin{frame}{Conclusion}
    \begin{itemize}
        \item The rise of Computational Social Science (CSS) has redefined social science research, influencing methodological boundaries across disciplines.
        \item Our analysis of 11 million papers highlights:
        \begin{itemize}
            \item Varying adoption of CSS methods across disciplines like sociology, psychology, economics, and political science.
            \item CSS's evolution from fragmented beginnings to a cohesive, integrated field.
        \end{itemize}
