K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN) is a non-parametric, flexible method suited for emotion recognition and early seizure detection, adapting to individualized neural activity \cite{li2018emotion, birjandtalab2017automated}. It offers low-complexity training without weight optimizations, but can be computationally expensive during inference on large datasets \cite{sharmila2016dwt}.

