In conclusion, we have provided an overview of several user-centric benefits that could be the focus of future evaluations of XAI systems within the arts.
These benefits, could both shape the evaluation of XAI tools, as well as the design of explanations used themselves.
From this, we hope to spur discussion and motivate fellow researchers to focus on evaluations of XAI tools that focus on user-centric benefits, such as emotional well-being and self-reflection.


