%We propose a synthesis algorithm using the well-known abstraction-based control framework, and demonstrate the effectiveness of generalized shields on a robotic path planning task in an unknown environment where the obstacle locations are unknown to the shield apriori.

\keywords{Dynamic shields  \and parametric safety \and symbolic control.}
\end{abstract}
