% \end{figure}

When further in-depth reverse analysis of \texttt{widevine\_dash\_cmd\_handler()}, there is a pointer pointing to a table. After analyzing and inferring some types, it is a dash command table, which records command id, command pointer, etc, and other information in (Listing \ref{fig:cmd_table}). 

