\section{Candidate-Free R-S Joins (CF-RS-Joins)} \label{sec:A-tree based method}
To eliminate the candidate generation for better R-S Join computation efficiency, our solution is to design tree structures to compress elements and their associated set into memory and integrate filtering and verification into one single stage.
