\label{theorem: SBM lower bound}
For any sequence $\rho_n>0$, we have
\begin{align*}
\underset{\widehat{W}}{\inf}
\underset{W\in \mathcal W[2]}{\sup}
    {\P}_{W} \left ( \opnorm{\widehat \bbW(\bA) - \rho_n \bbW } \ge \rho_n n^{-1/4} / 16 \right ) \ge \frac{1}{4},
