	let $\+S'$ be an array induced by $\tau[x, y]$ with all elements being empty. We call {\sc WaveFront}$(\tau_k, \tau[x,y], \delta', \+S, \+S')$. Let $\bar{\+S}$ be the output array for $y$. By Lemma~\ref{lem: wave}, $\bar{\+S}$ is a feasible answer for the query. It takes $O(\mu_1)$ time.

