		We restate the query {\bf{\sc Cover}} with a subcurve $\tau'$ of $\tau_k$, an array $\+S$ induced by $\tau_k$, and $\delta'>0$. The start and end of $\tau'$ may not be vertices. The value $\epsilon\in(0,1)$ is known during preprocessing.

